{"seq":2,"slug":"ideation-prototyping","title":"创意发想与原型","stage":"DONE","category":"design-thinking","chapterCount":3,"docCount":14,"url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 创意发想与原型 简介\n\n创意发想与原型制作是设计思维中从问题到解决方案的核心环节。在明确了用户需求和问题定义之后，如何产出大量创意并快速验证其可行性，是决定创新成败的关键步骤。通过系统的创意发想方法和快速原型技术，团队能够在投入大量资源之前发现最有价值的方向。\n\n本知识库面向需要在项目中实践创意发想和原型验证的学习者，无论你是产品设计师、产品经理、工程师还是创业团队成员，都能在这里找到可直接应用的方法和工具。\n\n全书共分为三章，从创意的大量产出到快速可视化，再到用户验证和迭代优化，构成完整的从想法到验证的闭环。\n\n第一章**头脑风暴方法**介绍多种经过验证的创意产出技术，从发散思维的基本原理到结构化的头脑风暴工具再到创意筛选的决策方法，帮助你在短时间内产出大量有价值的创意。\n\n第二章**原型制作技术**讲解从低保真到高保真的各类原型制作方法，涵盖纸面原型、数字原型和体验原型，帮助你学会用最小的成本和最快的速度将创意转化为可感知、可测试的具体形态。\n\n第三章**测试与迭代**聚焦原型的验证和优化过程，涵盖可用性测试方法、反馈循环的构建、何时转向何时坚持的决策框架以及迭代模式的选择，帮助你建立基于真实用户反馈持续改进的能力。\n\n推荐学习路径为先通过第一章掌握创意产出方法，再通过第二章学会快速原型制作，最后通过第三章建立测试与迭代的完整闭环。建议在实际项目中边学边用，每个方法都要动手实践。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"brainstorming-methods","title":"头脑风暴方法","docCount":4,"url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/brainstorming-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"divergent-thinking","title":"发散思维与创意拓展","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/brainstorming-methods/divergent-thinking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"structured-brainstorming","title":"结构化头脑风暴","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/brainstorming-methods/structured-brainstorming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crazy-eights","title":"Crazy Eights 快速构思法","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/brainstorming-methods/crazy-eights"},{"seq":4,"slug":"idea-selection","title":"创意筛选与决策方法","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/brainstorming-methods/idea-selection"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"prototyping-techniques","title":"原型制作技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/prototyping-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paper-prototyping","title":"纸质原型设计","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/prototyping-techniques/paper-prototyping"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-prototyping","title":"数字原型工具与方法","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/prototyping-techniques/digital-prototyping"},{"seq":3,"slug":"experience-prototyping","title":"体验原型与服务模拟","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/prototyping-techniques/experience-prototyping"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-and-iteration","title":"测试与迭代","docCount":7,"url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/testing-and-iteration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"usability-testing","title":"可用性测试方法","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/testing-and-iteration/usability-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feedback-analysis","title":"反馈收集与分析","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/testing-and-iteration/feedback-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pivot-or-persevere","title":"坚持还是转向","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/testing-and-iteration/pivot-or-persevere"},{"seq":4,"slug":"design-sprint","title":"Design Sprint 五天冲刺","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/testing-and-iteration/design-sprint"},{"seq":5,"slug":"feedback-loops","title":"反馈回路","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/testing-and-iteration/feedback-loops"},{"seq":6,"slug":"rapid-iteration","title":"快速迭代循环","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/testing-and-iteration/rapid-iteration"},{"seq":7,"slug":"iteration-patterns","title":"迭代模式","url":"/h/design-thinking/ideation-prototyping/testing-and-iteration/iteration-patterns"}]}]}